    "directions": [
      "In a mortar pestle, add green chillies, ginger, garlic,cloves and grind it into a rough paste and keep aside for further use.",
      "In a shallow pan, add ghee, oil and once it's hot, add prepared ginger garlic paste, cumin seeds and let it splutter well.",
      "Add onion and saute until it's translucent. Add coriander powder, degi red chilli powder, turmeric powder and saute it well.",
      "Add salt to taste, tomatoes, sugar and mix it well. Cover it with the lid and cook on low flame.",
      "Once the tomatoes are soft, add water and mix it well. Cover it with the lid and cook for 5 minutes.",
      "Add crushed dry fenugreek leaves, coriander leaves and mix it well.",
      "Once done, transfer it into a serving dish, place the prepared egg cake on top.",
      "Garnish it with coriander sprig and serve hot.",
      "In a bowl break eggs, add salt to taste, turmeric powder, degi red chilli powder, ghee and whisk it well.",
      "Take a medium size bowl, pour the egg mixture into the bowl and let it steam for 10 minutes.",
      "Or until it's properly done.",
      "Remove it from the pan, demould the egg cake and cut into desired shape."
    ],
